@startuml CU-35
actor "Administrador" as Adm
boundary "«UI» Angular (Admin/Reporte Consolidado)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /reports/consolidated" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» ReportService / Sale, Inventory, Receipt, Branch" as Model
database "«DB» PostgreSQL (Neon)" as DB

Adm -> UI : 1: Accede a "Reporte Consolidado"
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /reports/consolidated?start_date=...&end_date=...&branch_id=1
Ctrl -> Model : 3: get_consolidated_report(start_date, end_date, branch_id)
Model -> DB : 4: JOINs Sale + Branch + Inventory + Product
Model -> Model : 5: Agrega ventas por sucursal (total, tickets, ticket_prom)
Model -> Model : 6: Agrega stock por sucursal (items, valor, stock_bajo)
Model -> Model : 7: Métricas cruzadas (rotación, sell-through)
Model --> Ctrl : 8: ConsolidatedResponse {branches[{sales{}, inventory{}, metrics{}}], summary{}}
Ctrl --> UI : 9: ConsolidatedResponse
UI --> Adm : 10: Dashboard consolidado por sucursal

Adm -> UI : 1: Exporta Excel (opcional)
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /reports/consolidated?...&format=excel
Ctrl -> Model : 3: get_consolidated_report(...)
Model -> Model : 4: Genera Excel multi-hoja
Model --> Ctrl : 5: Archivo Excel / Stream
Ctrl --> UI : 6: Descarga
UI --> Adm : 7: Excel descargado

note right of Adm : Métricas:\n- Ventas: total, tickets, ticket_prom, items_vendidos\n- Stock: total_items, valor, stock_bajo, agotados\n- Cruzadas: rotación, sell-through, días_inventario\n- Resumen: totales globales, top/bottom sucursales

@enduml